        "          REPORT NUMBER ONE    ",
        "        FROM FILMON THE SAGE         ",
        "             ",
        "       IN J. R. TROLKIN'S CASTLE     ",
        "    THERE IS A SECRET CONTROL ROOM   ",
        "    WHICH CAN BE ACCESSED FROM ONE   ",
        "    OF TWO SECRET PASSAGES.  THE     ",
        "    FIRST STARTS IN J. R. TROLKIN'S  ",
        "    ROOM.                ",
        "                                ",
        "       THE OTHER STARTS BETWEEN THE  ",
